OL,3,GNEWSAAlan Carr immortalised in street
OL,4,Aart festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthampton's Alan Carr has been
OL,7,Fimmortalised in a mural as part of one
OL,8,Fof Europe's largest street art events.
OL,10,FFrom Saturday 29 August to Monday 31
OL,11,FAugust the town became a "living
OL,12,Fcanvas" as more than 360 artists came
OL,13,Ftogether to paint over walls and
OL,14,Fbuildings that were earmarked as
OL,15,Fneeding improvement and to cover
OL,16,Fillegal graffiti.
OL,18,FWall Games was founded by artist James
OL,19,FThompson in the hopes of bringing more
OL,20,Fpeople to the town and leaving a
OL,21,Flasting legacy.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
