OL,3,GNEWSAAlan Carr immortalised in street
OL,4,Aart festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "It's a legacy we are trying
OL,7,Fto leave here to create a street art
OL,8,Ftrail and a tour that doesn't just last
OL,9,Ffor the weekend, but lasts for a longer
OL,10,Fperiod and gives people a reason to
OL,11,Fcome and visit the town."
